"Robotic and encoded systems require coordinate-frame calibration, tool-centre-point verification, base-frame and fixture alignment, encoder synchronisation, path planning, collision control and data registration. AI-assisted interpretation requires representative labelled data, independent validation, control of false positives and false negatives, version control and qualified human review. A high test-set accuracy score alone does not establish probability of detection.",
